    - target: {fileID: 2727170247391517062, guid: 61d5ee3d589b12949b4ba9b9376b5098,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Finally, you will be tested on your memory of which objects you saw.
        \n\nThe controller will be used to touch one of 2 response orbs.\n\nTouch
        the <b>OLD</b> orb if the object <b>WAS ON</b> the table.\nTouch the <b>NEW</b>
